{"3600990":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Sinker sound","steam_appid":3600990,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3600990\/extras\/d713e6b1757963bcddceddcc5c233732.poster.avif?t=1794637890\" width=1144 height=656 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3600990\/extras\/d713e6b1757963bcddceddcc5c233732.webm?t=1794637890\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3600990\/extras\/d713e6b1757963bcddceddcc5c233732.mp4?t=1794637890\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a Fishing game with a Rhythm gimmick!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish here are all move to the rhythm of the music!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3600990\/extras\/6916c0328d8785773dccaa39dd0fa4fc.avif?t=1794637890\" width=600 height=90 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>REEL TO THE BEAT!<\/strong> <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish here are all move to the rhythm of the music!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reeling is essential, and you must reel to the beat of the song!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch several fishes each with their own original song!<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute retro 3D graphics!<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visuals inspired by early 2000's aesthetics!<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore strange locations in the lake, how much deeper does this lake go?<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a curious fisher who felt the calling to come to this mysterious lake.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish here are affected by the power of the mermaid, and you must learn to sync with their music in order to fish for them.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eventually you will find out how much deeper this lake can go.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features  <\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Rhythm gameplay! - Fishing in this game will be to the beat of the song and you must maintain the line tension at all cost!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make melodies along with the music! - Reeling in this game will also play melodies along with the music. Making music feels unique every time you fish!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore many strange environments! - You may get to fish in a place that you never thought to fish before!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A strange collection of fish! - Many fish aren't anything you've seen before! They can be quite strange.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a Custom fish chart editor! - you can create your own custom fish and share them to other players!<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3600990\/extras\/d713e6b1757963bcddceddcc5c233732.poster.avif?t=1794637890\" width=1144 height=656 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3600990\/extras\/d713e6b1757963bcddceddcc5c233732.webm?t=1794637890\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3600990\/extras\/d713e6b1757963bcddceddcc5c233732.mp4?t=1794637890\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a Fishing game with a Rhythm gimmick!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish here are all move to the rhythm of the music!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3600990\/extras\/6916c0328d8785773dccaa39dd0fa4fc.avif?t=1794637890\" width=600 height=90 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>REEL TO THE BEAT!<\/strong> <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish here are all move to the rhythm of the music!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reeling is essential, and you must reel to the beat of the song!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch several fishes each with their own original song!<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute retro 3D graphics!<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visuals inspired by early 2000's aesthetics!<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore strange locations in the lake, how much deeper does this lake go?<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a curious fisher who felt the calling to come to this mysterious lake.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish here are affected by the power of the mermaid, and you must learn to sync with their music in order to fish for them.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eventually you will find out how much deeper this lake can go.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features  <\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Rhythm gameplay! - Fishing in this game will be to the beat of the song and you must maintain the line tension at all cost!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make melodies along with the music! - Reeling in this game will also play melodies along with the music. Making music feels unique every time you fish!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore many strange environments! - You may get to fish in a place that you never thought to fish before!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A strange collection of fish! - Many fish aren't anything you've seen before! They can be quite strange.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a Custom fish chart editor! - you can create your own custom fish and share them to other players!<\/p>","short_description":"Fish in the strange domain of the mermaid, and find many strange fish with their own unique original music! You must REEL to the beat of the song! This is a fishing game with a musical rhythm gimmick!","supported_languages":"English, Thai","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3600990\/4bd01c94fe90ae234e3d410503197d8b15ae08f2\/header.jpg?t=1794637890","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3600990\/a3ba51e0e3e4ff5b354d531b1e8f02c8b711f89e\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1794637890","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3600990\/a3ba51e0e3e4ff5b354d531b1e8f02c8b711f89e\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1794637890","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Window 10<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i7-7700HQ 2.8GHz<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Nvidia Geforce GTX 1050<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 2 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> Version 11<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requiremen